CM_ SG_ 571 A23B_B0_CHECK_BYTE "Check byte: CRC8 (poly 0x1D, init 0, MSB first) over B1, B2, XOR 0x59, then XOR 0x3B / 0x76 / 0xEC / 0xC5 for set bits 4 / 5 / 6 / 7 of B1. Startup frames 00 0F FF differ.";
CM_ SG_ 571 A23B_STATUS_MUX4 "Byte-1 low nibble: high bits of the target width (1 for widths of 256 cm and more).";
CM_ SG_ 571 A23B_TARGET_WIDTH_CM "Width of the ACC target, cm: 0 without a target, 140-220 for the car class (median 171), 200-280 for the truck class.";
CM_ SG_ 571 A23B_COUNTER4 "Rolling counter.";
